**Order:**
1. Node built-ins: `node:assert/strict`, `node:fs/promises`, `node:path`, `node:test`, `node:url`
2. Workspace or external packages: `@mobile-e2e-mcp/contracts`, `@mobile-e2e-mcp/core`, `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`
