- `README.zh-CN.md`
- `package.json`

## Next Step

The vivo live proof has been promoted into compact tracked showcase evidence under `docs/showcase/evidence/governed-control-vivo-2026-05-23/`, with full UI hierarchy and runtime artifacts kept out of git.
